        "evidence": "In common/src/paid-social-capi.ts, buildPaidSocialRequest for the tiktok platform now calls the new tikTokEventPage helper and uses params.surface to map activation events to freebuff.com/desktop or freebuff.com/cli instead of throwing for non-registration events, with SendPaidSocialConversionParams gaining a surface?: 'web' | 'desktop' | 'cli' field",
        "userVisible": false,
        "breaking": true,
        "migration": "Callers sending TikTok activation events to sendPaidSocialConversion must now pass a surface value of desktop or cli, since web surfaces no longer produce a product page and the previous hard error is replaced by a page-mapped CUSTOM event.",
